<title>USA: Key IMM currency futures mixed in rangebound trade.</title>
<headline>Key IMM currency futures mixed in rangebound trade.</headline>
<text>
<p>April 23 - Key IMM currency futures were mixed in rangebound morning trade, with marks and yen slightly higher in quiet action. June sterling at one week low in good volume on technical weakness. Traders note various levels of sell-stops. Canadian dollar slightly higher, trade there active, a trader said.</p>
<p>((Chicago Derivatives Desk (312)408-8750/))</p>
